@startuml
actor Admin
actor Customer
participant "Telangana RTA" as RTA
participant "Django View" as View
participant "Dataset Loader" as Loader
participant "Training Pipeline" as Trainer
participant "Predictor" as Predictor
database "Artifacts" as Artifacts

Admin -> View: Request model training
View -> Loader: normalize_dataset(dataset_key)
Loader --> View: normalized dataframe
View -> Trainer: train(dataset_key, output_dir)
Trainer -> Loader: load normalized features
Trainer -> Artifacts: save model and metrics
Artifacts --> Trainer: saved files
Trainer --> View: metrics
View --> Admin: show model metrics

Customer -> View: Submit vehicle details
View -> RTA: Read registration age and ownership context
RTA --> View: vehicle context
View -> Predictor: predict_price(vehicle + RTA context)
Predictor -> Artifacts: load trained model
Artifacts --> Predictor: model pipeline
Predictor --> View: predicted price
View --> Customer: show predicted price and advice
@enduml
